Mustel — automation CLI for PostgreSQL queries, database backups and server settings

Usage: mustel [COMMAND]

Commands:
  query     Execute SQL queries and export results to CSV
  database  Database utilities
  settings  Manage Mustel settings and server configurations
  gui       Open the graphical interface
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
